### Variables
@baseUrl = http://192.168.0.254:8000/api/v1
@skillId = d30466cb-ba14-48cd-ac27-39e81472c52a
@sessionId = {{createSession.response.body.id}}
@session2Id = {{createSession2.response.body.id}}

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

# ============================================
# SETUP - CREATE SKILLS FOR TESTING
# ============================================

### Create Skill for Sessions
# @name createSkill
POST {{baseUrl}}/skills/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Customer Support",
  "description": "Skill para atendimento ao cliente",
  "questions": {
    "q1": "Como você lida com clientes insatisfeitos?",
    "q2": "Descreva técnicas de comunicação eficaz",
    "q3": "Como priorizar múltiplas solicitações?"
  }
}

###

### Create Second Skill
# @name createSkill2
POST {{baseUrl}}/skills/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Technical Support",
  "description": "Skill para suporte técnico",
  "questions": {
    "q1": "Como fazer troubleshooting eficiente?",
    "q2": "Explique processos de diagnóstico"
  }
}

###

# ============================================
# SESSION CRUD OPERATIONS
# ============================================

### Create Session
# @name createSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skill_id": "d30466cb-ba14-48cd-ac27-39e81472c52a"
}

###

### Create Second Session
# @name createSession2
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skill_id": "{{skillId}}"
}

###

### Create Session with Second Skill
# @name createSession3
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skill_id": "{{createSkill2.response.body.id}}"
}

###

### Try Create Session with Non-existent Skill (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skill_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

###

### Try Create Session with Inactive Skill (should return 400)
# First, deactivate the skill
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/skills/{{skillId}}/deactivate

### Then try to create session
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skill_id": "{{skillId}}"
}

### Reactivate skill for other tests
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/skills/{{skillId}}/activate

###

### List All Sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/

###

### List Sessions with Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/?limit=10

###

### List Sessions with Custom Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/?limit=50

###

### Get Session by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}

###

### Get Non-existent Session (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

### List Sessions by Skill ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/skill/{{skillId}}

###

### List Sessions by Skill with Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/skill/{{skillId}}?limit=5

###

### List Sessions by Non-existent Skill (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/skill/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

# ============================================
# MESSAGE OPERATIONS
# ============================================

### Add Message to Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Olá! Gostaria de tirar algumas dúvidas sobre atendimento ao cliente."
}

###

### Add Second Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "olá"
}

###

### Add Third Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Entendi. E quanto tempo devo esperar antes de fazer o follow-up?"
}

###

### Add Message with Parameters
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages?params={"user_id": "12345", "channel": "web"}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Esta mensagem tem parâmetros adicionais no contexto."
}

###

### Add Message with Empty Text (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": ""
}

###

### Add Message with Only Whitespace (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "   "
}

###

### Add Message to Non-existent Session (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Tentando adicionar a sessão inexistente"
}

###

### Get All Messages from Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages

###

### Get Messages from Empty Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{session2Id}}/messages

###

### Get Message Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages/count

###

### Get Message Count from Empty Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{session2Id}}/messages/count

###

### Get Message Count from Non-existent Session (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/messages/count

###

# ============================================
# SESSION WORKFLOW EXAMPLE
# ============================================

### Complete Session Flow - Create Session
# @name workflowSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skill_id": "{{skillId}}"
}

###

### Add Question 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{workflowSession.response.body.id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Como você lida com clientes insatisfeitos?"
}

###

### Add Answer 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{workflowSession.response.body.id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Primeiro, ouço atentamente as preocupações do cliente sem interrompê-lo..."
}

###

### Add Question 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{workflowSession.response.body.id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Descreva técnicas de comunicação eficaz"
}

###

### Add Answer 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{workflowSession.response.body.id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Utilizo escuta ativa, empatia e comunicação clara e objetiva..."
}

###

### View Complete Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{workflowSession.response.body.id}}

###

### View Message Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{workflowSession.response.body.id}}/messages/count

###

# ============================================
# SESSION DELETION
# ============================================

### Delete Session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}

###

### Try to Get Deleted Session (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}

###

### Try to Add Message to Deleted Session (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Tentando adicionar a sessão deletada"
}

###

### Delete Non-existent Session (should return 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

# ============================================
# ERROR CASES
# ============================================

### Invalid UUID Format
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/invalid-uuid-format

###

### Create Session with Invalid Skill ID Format
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skill_id": "invalid-uuid"
}

###

### Create Session Missing skill_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing skill_id"
}

###

### Add Message Missing text field
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{session2Id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "params": {"test": "value"}
}

